"ABOUT_TITLE" = "About";
"ABOUT_TEXT" = "Clock2go is a time clock application that allows you to report attendance anywhere and anytime! The app provides you a variety of advanced tools for the employee: Reporting on tasks and projects, reporting on a variety of absences, viewing reports and completing reports by permission, sending documents, set alerts and more! \
The app was developed and designed so that any organization can flexibly adjust the app's settings according to their needs! \
In cock2go, we focused on the employee experience in using the app comfortably and in a friendly way that puts him in the center! \
It is important that you know that the data is stored in the company's database and transferred to the organization according to its requirements and according to the agreement between the company and the employer. The time of signing (start / end of work) and date are taken from the system server, the phone location at the time of signing will be sent according to the requirements of the organization and subject to the device technologies and data received from the cellular network and satellites. Please note that each session of the presence app involves browsing according to the conditions of the browsing program that you are in and may be charged a fee in accordance with the agreement between you and your communications provider. Also, due to the use of the integrated positioning system on the device - the use of the device battery may be shortened.";
