The software is intended for subscribers who use the presence, solely for the purpose of stamping the presence and anyone who uses it, including copying, reproducing, modifying or distributing the software or data or any part thereof, violates the license to use the software, and is subject to civil and criminal lawsuits. When reporting the presence, the system locates the location of the device at the time of reporting only and it is registered for the purpose of controlling and verifying the data and is transferred for the needs of the subscription organization that ordered the service. The information is stored in the system for half a year and / or in special cases according to the needs and definitions of the customer in maintaining attendance data.\
