The user declares that he agrees to the said conditions and that the use of the software constitutes his consent to all the terms of the license, including what is stated in this document.\
The user undertakes to operate and use the software solely subject to the license terms applicable to the software, as determined from time to time by the company.\
In any case, the company is not liable to the user, in any liability and the user must make sure that his attendance reports correspond to the reporter according to the software.\
The user releases the company from any liability and / or responsibility whatsoever and / or error in relation to the attendance reports and / or imprints as received and / or processed and / or provided to his employers by the software and / or by the company.\
When registering for the system, the identification number of the device will be registered next to the telephone number, and after an initial report, it will be possible to continue reporting only from this device in order to prevent forgeries.\
During registration, an SMS message will be sent to the subscriber with a registration code for the purpose of identifying and verifying one-time the reported number. If the correct code is entered, further reporting will be possible. \"";
