"about_content" = "The clock2go attendance clock application allows you to report attendance from anywhere and at any time!\
\
The application provides you with a variety of advanced tools for the employee:\
\
Reporting on tasks and projects, reporting on various types of absences, viewing reports and completing reports according to permission, sending documents to the organization, travel, reminders and more!\
\
The application was developed and designed so that any organization can flexibly adjust the application settings according to its needs!\
\
In the clock2go app, we put emphasis on the employee's experience using the app in a comfortable and friendly way that puts the employee at the center!\
\
It is important that you know that the data will be stored in the company's database and transferred to the organization in accordance with its requirements and according to the agreement between the company and the employer. The signing time (start/end of work) and the date are taken from the system server, the location of the phone at the time of signing will be sent according to the organization's requirements and subject to the device technologies and the data received from the cellular network and satellites. Please note that each activation of the presence application involves browsing in accordance with the terms of the browsing plan you are in and may be required to pay a fee in accordance with the agreement between you and your communication provider. Also, due to the use of the integral positioning system in the device - the time of use of the device's battery may be shortened.";
