"terms_for_tracking" = "Terms of use for Tracking";
"terms_for_tracking_content" = "I agree to show others the location of my phone even if the application is closed on my phone.\
\
The service uses the internal GPS of the device for the purposes of measuring the distance during the travel time, due to the continuous use there is an effect on the consumption of the battery life.\
\
If the application only works in the background, the battery will be low.\
\
The system will keep location history for three months for control purposes and will investigate customer problems and complaints. Beyond that, it is the company's responsibility to make backups and/or print the reports every month.\
\
The user is aware that not activating the GPS on the device (Settings screen) will not allow the tracking of the subscriber\
\
Being inside a closed building, an underground parking lot, tunnels, etc. may cause a lack of location or an inaccurate location and as a result there may be deviations in the measurement.\
